的に常識が欠如しているからであり、性格は素直で良い子。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公を執事（奴隷？）としてこき使うが、主人公がいかにも執事として「煌々様」と呼んだりするとトタンに不機嫌になる不思議。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「将来にそなえて宮乃（以下略）の跡取りたるもの“えっち”にも慣れておかなければ」というピントのずれた建前で、無理矢理主人公と関係を結んだりする。だがエッチの知識も偏っていたり勘違いしているため、よくわからないコスプレ系Hやらが多くなる。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"221811"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/d4/d4d714e3fa8fb1918d6604bd9e56ea8a675b62d689a0daa17a439f236721ba03.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/2d/2d5d7fe07bd1761f8b64e5f5507a5c9a201663a3e1b64532cde12ed366880549.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c53629","characterName":"朝霧　正貴","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c53629"},"originalCharacterName":"朝霧　正貴","characterNameSource":null,"role":"main","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c57508","characterName":"藤野 広紀","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c57508"},"originalCharacterName":"藤野 広紀","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/97/9772a165e3b7c2129819f1711fe1098777ee0b897298014347885f10f0b52cc6.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/30/30dc9e9131b0695ed2a4c5d24f8698846b4d01344d84f6068b7e700c6de360d0.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]}],"songs":[],"companies":[{"companyId":"vndb:p534","sourceCompanyId":"egs